    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HELLLLLCAFEEEEE&quot;</strong> is an adventure game set in a strange caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757540/extras/a022f58bd73bb49fa9c91e3bef75155d.avif?t=1750822243\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why am I serving coffee to <i>them</i> here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What even is this caf\u00e9 to me?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird customers keep saying things to me, and I just listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u2026 for what purpose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually, where <i>is</i> this place? I don\u2019t understand anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I keep working, hoping that someday I\u2019ll get out of here\u2014go somewhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757540/extras/08c55d22942734ecb1ae045012191644.avif?t=1750822243\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events happen as you move around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits\u2014enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <i>they</i> won\u2019t stop talking to <i>you</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: 30\u201360 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without permission for both individuals and organizations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;HELLLLLCAFEEEEE&quot;</strong> is an adventure game set in a strange caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757540/extras/a022f58bd73bb49fa9c91e3bef75155d.avif?t=1750822243\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why am I serving coffee to <i>them</i> here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What even is this caf\u00e9 to me?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird customers keep saying things to me, and I just listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u2026 for what purpose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually, where <i>is</i> this place? I don\u2019t understand anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I keep working, hoping that someday I\u2019ll get out of here\u2014go somewhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757540/extras/08c55d22942734ecb1ae045012191644.avif?t=1750822243\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events happen as you move around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits\u2014enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <i>they</i> won\u2019t stop talking to <i>you</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: 30\u201360 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without permission for both individuals and organizations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
